---
---

<section class="trustly-about-hero">
  <div class="container hero-container">
    <div class="hero-split-header">
      <div class="header-left">
        <h1 class="hero-main-title">
          Inclusión laboral sin barreras telefónicas en <span
            class="highlight-cyan">Bolivia</span
          >
        </h1>
      </div>

      <div class="header-right">
        <p class="hero-lead-text">
          Somos la primera plataforma boliviana diseñada exclusivamente para
          conectar a profesionales con hipoacusia con empresas formales donde
          todo se coordina <strong>100% por chat, WhatsApp y tareas escritas</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Centerpiece Visual Bento Showcase -->
    <div class="about-centerpiece-box">
      <img
        src="/images/about/equipo-colaboracion.jpg"
        alt="Equipo colaborando en oficina moderna e inclusiva"
        class="centerpiece-img"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="centerpiece-overlay"></div>
      <div class="centerpiece-caption">
        <p class="caption-quote">
          "Eliminamos las llamadas telefónicas sorpresa que descartan
          injustamente el talento más disciplinado del país."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.trustly-about-hero {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    padding-top: calc(90px + var(--space-12));
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-12);
  }

  .hero-split-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: var(--space-10);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .hero-main-title {
    font-size: var(--text-hero);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .highlight-cyan {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .hero-lead-text {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero-lead-text strong {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-centerpiece-box {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 480px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-dark);
    box-shadow: none;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-dark);
  }

  .centerpiece-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: brightness(0.65);
  }

  .centerpiece-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.1) 0%,
      rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.8) 100%
    );
  }

  .centerpiece-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: var(--space-8);
    left: var(--space-8);
    right: var(--space-8);
    max-width: 780px;
    z-index: 5;
  }


  .caption-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-white);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.35;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .hero-split-header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about-centerpiece-box {
      height: 380px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .about-centerpiece-box {
      height: 300px;
    }
    .caption-quote {
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
    }
  }
</style>
